---
import Band from '../components/Band.astro'
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---

<BaseLayout
	title="About"
	description="What kind of organisation Radix DAO LLC is, and how authority is structured."
>
	<Band>
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-bold md:text-4xl">What Radix DAO is</h1>
		<div class="prose-body mt-6 max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
			<p>
				Radix DAO LLC is a non-profit Decentralized Autonomous Organization registered under
				Marshall Islands law. It exists to hold and direct the resources the community
				contributes to Radix's public goods, under rules the community itself sets and can
				change by vote.
			</p>
			<p>
				At formation it is <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">member-managed</strong> and
				community governance is <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]">advisory</strong>. It
				becomes fully community-governed at the Activation Date, once the framework is ratified
				and a Council is elected.
			</p>
			<p>
				The organisation runs on one repeated idea: <strong class="text-[var(--color-text)]"
					>execution bodies execute, they do not govern.</strong
				> Token holders decide what happens. Elected roles carry it out, on a leash they can be voted
				off of.
			</p>
		</div>
		<a
			href="/govern/"
			class="mt-6 inline-block font-medium text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline"
			>Read the governance framework <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span></a
		>
	</Band>

	<Band raised>
		<h2 class="text-xl font-bold">How authority flows</h2>
		<ol class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-4">
			<li class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-4 text-sm">
				<p class="font-semibold">Token holders</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Propose and vote on everything.</p>
			</li>
			<li class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-4 text-sm">
				<p class="font-semibold">Accountability Council</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Elected. Guards the process, doesn't rule it.</p>
			</li>
			<li class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-4 text-sm">
				<p class="font-semibold">Delegated Functions</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Council members carrying out specific jobs — treasury, legal, compliance, Web2.</p>
			</li>
			<li class="rounded-lg border border-[var(--color-border)] p-4 text-sm">
				<p class="font-semibold">Working Groups</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Elected Stewards executing within an approved budget.</p>
			</li>
		</ol>
		<a href="/people/" class="mt-6 inline-block font-medium text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:underline"
			>See who holds these roles today <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span></a
		>
	</Band>
</BaseLayout>
